Technologies, Ola Electric, and Krutrim, each contributing to our mission of redefining mobility, advancing sustainable transportation, and pioneering AI innovation.<br><br><div><span>At ANI Technologies, we operate Ola Cabs, India's leading ride-hailing platform, serving over 250 million customers across 3 continents, offering employees a fast-paced, tech-driven environment where innovation thrives. Ola Electric is at the forefront of the electric vehicle revolution, with our state-of-the-art Futurefactory in Tamil Nadu, producing over 5 million electric two-wheelers annually and creating thousands of jobs. Krutrim, our AI arm, is dedicated to developing cutting-edge artificial intelligence models and infrastructure, empowering India to lead in the digital age.</span><div><br></div><div>Job Summary:&#10;</div><div>The Model-Based Developer role involves designing and developing control algorithms for EV powertrain, battery management systems (BMS), Charger, Vehicle control system, ABS and its dynamics using MATLAB/Simulink, and collaborating with cross-functional teams to implement high-performance, production-ready embedded software solutions.&#10;<br><br></div><div>Key Result Areas:&#10;</div><div>Control Algorithm Development: Design and implement model-based control algorithms for EV powertrain, Charger, and Vehicle control systems.&#10;</div><div>Model-Based Design (MBD): Develop MATLAB/Simulink/Stateflow models for embedded control applications.&#10;</div><div>Auto Code Generation &amp; Optimization: Generate optimized Embedded C code using Embedded Coder for real-time execution.&#10;</div><div>Software Integration: Integrated model-based control strategies into vehicle ECU embedded software for production deployment.&#10;</div><div>Calibration &amp; Parameter Tuning: Develop models with scalability and control parameters tunability for real-world vehicle applications.&#10;</div><div>Compliance &amp; Standards: Ensure AUTOSAR, ISO 26262, and functional safety compliance in software development.&#10;</div><div>Documentation &amp; Reviews: Maintain detailed documentation of control models, software architecture, and implementation strategies.&#10;<br><br></div><div>Competency Requirements:&#10;</div><div>B.Tech/M.Tech in Electrical, Electronics, Mechatronics, or Automotive Engineering.&#10;</div><div>MATLAB, Simulink, Stateflow &#8211; strong expertise in control model development.&#10;</div><div>Embedded Coder &#8211; auto-code generation and model optimization.&#10;</div><div>Experience in Model-in-loop, Hardware-in-loop, and Python scripting.&#10;</div><div>Knowledge of control systems and power electronics is essential.&#10;</div><div>Understanding of the vehicle electrical architecture and behaviour of electrical components in EV.&#10;</div><div>Good to have knowledge/experience in C/C++ programming, and MISRA C guidelines. &#10;</div><div>Good to have knowledge about different automotive systems (ECU software) and communication protocols (CAN, LIN, ETHERNET etc).&#10;<br><br></div><div>Perks of working with Ola:&#10;</div><div>Build technology that impacts millions at massive scale.&#10;</div><div>Work with top engineers solving complex, high-performance problems.&#10;</div><div>Exposure to cutting-edge systems across mobility, EV, and AI businesses.&#10;</div><div>High ownership and visibility with leadership.&#10;</div><div>Fast-track career growth in a high-velocity engineering environment.</div><div>&#10;</div><div>&#10;</div><div>&#10;</div></div>","additional_details":null,"is_notification_muted":true,"is_withdrawal_same_as_application_deadline":false,"is_new_company":false,"is_display_name_same_as_company_name":true,"is_included_in_application_matrix":false,"display_name":"Ola","is_published":true,"is_deleted":false,"is_process_completed":false,"created_by":9894,"created_by_name":"Ansh Kumar","updated_by":8526,"created_at":1764415263000,"updated_at":1764575479000,"company_query":{"overview":null,"city":null,"